---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { BUYER_LINE } from "../data/consent";
// ⚖ ATTORNEY REVIEW BEFORE LAUNCH (plan §12.1). The investor deal-texts A2P
// 10DLC campaign's privacy notice: buyer-only, so that campaign cites investor
// pages and the homeowner campaign keeps /privacy. Keep it consistent with
// /privacy, and with what newBuyer.js actually stores.
---

<Base
  title="Investor Privacy Notice | Hendrix Ventures Group"
  description="How Hendrix Ventures Group LLC handles the information real estate investors give us when they join our buyer list or opt in to deal texts."
  path="/investor-privacy"
  sticky="investor"
>
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h1>Investor Privacy Notice</h1>
      <p class="legal-effective">Effective November 11, 2026</p>
      <p>
        This notice covers real estate investors who join our buyer list at
        <a href="/investors">hendrixventures.com/investors</a> or opt in to
        our investor deal texts. The short version: we collect what you give
        us to send you deals, we protect it, we don't sell it, and we don't
        run third-party ad trackers.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>What you submit:</strong> your first and last name, mobile
          phone, email, and whether you buy as a landlord, a fix-and-flipper or
          both.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Consent records:</strong> when you join the buyer list we
          record the date and time, your IP address, your browser type, the
          exact wording of each checkbox shown to you and the version of each
          texting box's wording, and whether you checked each optional texting
          box.{
            // One line on purpose: Astro renders line breaks inside a fragment.
            BUYER_LINE && (
              <> When you text DEALS to our buyer line, <a href={BUYER_LINE.sms} style="white-space: nowrap">{BUYER_LINE.display}</a>, we keep your text, with its date and time, as the record of your opt-in.</>
            )
          } When you ask us in writing to send our deals by text, we keep your
          message, and record that you agreed in writing, for which number,
          when, and who recorded it. We keep these records to honor — and prove
          we honor — your communication choices.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Basic site analytics:</strong> we record page views and
          clicks using our own first-party system. It uses
          <strong>no cookies</strong>, no fingerprinting, and no third-party
          analytics or advertising services. IP addresses in these records are
          used for spam prevention.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        To tell you about investment properties we have available, by call
        and email, and by text only if you opt in to texts; to follow up on
        deals you respond to; to honor your communication preferences; and to
        understand how the site is used. We do not use your information for
        third-party advertising.
      </p>

      <h2>Investor deal texts</h2>
      <p>
        Deal texts are optional and not required to join the buyer list. We
        text only investors who opt in, and only about investment properties
        we have available and deals they respond to. Message frequency varies;
        message and data rates may apply. Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to opt
        out, <strong>HELP</strong> for help. Carriers are not liable for
        delayed or undelivered messages. See
        <a href="/investor-text-consent">how investors agree to texts</a> and
        our <a href="/investor-sms-terms">Investor SMS Terms</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What we never do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We do not sell your personal information.</li>
        <li>
          No mobile telephone numbers or SMS consent information are shared
          with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional
          purposes.
        </li>
        <li>We do not run advertising pixels or cross-site trackers.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Who processes it for us</h2>
      <p>
        Like nearly every website, we rely on service providers that process
        data on our behalf, under their own security programs, including our
        website host (Netlify, which also stores form submission copies), our
        database provider (Supabase, where signups and consent records are
        stored), the services that run our own buyer-list software, where a
        copy of your signup and consent record is kept, and our text-messaging
        provider. Service providers may
        process your information only to provide their service to us.
      </p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        Buyer-list records are retained for our business records; consent and
        opt-out records are retained for at least five years, as
        telemarketing rules expect. Analytics events contain no name or
        contact information.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any text from us to stop texts. Reply
          <strong>HELP</strong> for help. See our
          <a href="/investor-sms-terms">Investor SMS Terms</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          Email
          <a href="mailto:hasani@hendrixventures.com"
            >hasani@hendrixventures.com</a
          >
          to leave the buyer list, to ask what we have about you, to correct
          it, or to request deletion (we may retain what the law requires us to
          keep, such as opt-out records).
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        Our buyer list is for adults investing in real estate; we do not
        knowingly collect information from children under 13.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes &amp; contact</h2>
      <p>
        If we change this notice we'll change the date at the top. Questions:
        <a href="mailto:hasani@hendrixventures.com"
          >hasani@hendrixventures.com</a
        >
        · (678) 710-5786 · Hendrix Ventures Group LLC, 1700 Northside Dr NW,
        Suite A7 #813, Atlanta, GA 30318.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
